++### 15.2 입력
++
++```text
++OSOAA TAW:
++  TAW-1.340-03.0-RadMU48-NB200-SZA40.000-TSZA28.665
++angles:
++  pure_water_b443_s40/Advanced_outputs/RAD_UsedAngles.txt
++OCRT:
